);
COMMENT ON TABLE TB_TRD_BOE IS 'Bill of Entry(수입신고)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.BOE_MGMT_NO IS 'BoE 관리번호';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.BOE_NO IS 'BoE 번호 - BOE_NO+BOE_DT+PORT_CODE = IDPMS 자연키';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.BOE_DT IS 'BoE 일자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.PORT_CODE IS '세관 Port Code';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.BOE_TYPE IS 'BoE 구분 - 1Home Consumption/2Warehousing/3Ex-bond';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.CUST_NO IS '고객번호';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.IEC_NO IS 'IEC';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.AD_CODE IS 'AD Code';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.INV_MGMT_NO IS '인보이스 관리번호';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.PRODUCT_CODE IS 'BoE 상품코드 - RT13 Product Type과 상이 가능 → 차단 금지(기존 요청)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.CCY IS '통화';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.AMT IS '세전금액';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.IGST_RATE IS 'IGST 세율';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.IGST_AMT IS 'IGST 세액';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.TOTAL_AMT IS 'BoE 총액(Invoice Value)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.SETTLED_AMT IS '결제완료액 - Σ 배분액';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.OUTSTANDING_AMT IS '미결제액';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.SHIPMENT_DT IS '선적일(B/L) - 결제기한 기산';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.SETTLE_DUE_DT IS '결제기한 - SHIPMENT_DT + IMP_SETTLE_MONTHS';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.SOURCE IS '출처 - I:IDPMS 수신 / M:수기';
