COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.IDPMS_STS IS 'IDPMS 상태 - OPEN/PART/SETL/CLSD';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.CLOSURE_DT IS '종결일';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.CLOSURE_RSN IS '종결사유 - SETL/WOFF/RETN(반송)/SHRT(감액)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.REG_USER_ID IS '등록자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.REG_TS IS '등록일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.UPD_USER_ID IS '수정자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_TRD_BOE.UPD_TS IS '수정일시';
