COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_CIMS_RETURN.FILE_NAME IS '파일명 - XML/XBRL/CSV - 리턴명세';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_CIMS_RETURN.SUBMIT_TS IS '제출일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_CIMS_RETURN.ACK_NO IS 'RBI 접수번호';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_CIMS_RETURN.RETURN_STS IS '상태 - GEN/VAL/SUBM/ACK/REJ/RESB';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_CIMS_RETURN.REJ_REASON IS '반려사유';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_CIMS_RETURN.REG_USER_ID IS '등록자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_CIMS_RETURN.REG_TS IS '등록일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_CIMS_RETURN.UPD_USER_ID IS '수정자';
