COMMENT ON TABLE TB_FDI_ESCROW IS 'FDI 에스크로 계좌';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.ESCROW_ACCT_NO IS '에스크로 계좌';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.ESCROW_PURP IS '목적 - CODE:ESCROW_PURP';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.CCY IS '통화 - INR 또는 외화';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.NR_PARTY_NAME IS '비거주자 당사자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.NR_PARTY_CTRY IS '국가 - 인접국이면 정부승인 확인';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.R_PARTY_CUST_NO IS '거주자 당사자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.INVESTEE_CIN IS '대상회사 CIN';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.AGREEMENT_REF IS '에스크로 약정번호';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.AGREEMENT_DT IS '약정일';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.TOTAL_CONSIDERATION IS '총 거래대가 - 이연대가 비율 검증용';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.ESCROW_LIMIT IS '예치한도 - DEFER: 총대가×25% 이내';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.BALANCE_AMT IS '잔액';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.EXPIRY_DT IS '만기 - DEFER: 약정일+18개월 이내';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.RELEASE_COND IS '지급조건 - 약정 요약(결의·인가·클로징)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.ESCROW_STS IS '상태 - OPEN/PART/CLSD/RFND';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.REG_USER_ID IS '등록자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.REG_TS IS '등록일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.UPD_USER_ID IS '수정자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.UPD_TS IS '수정일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FDI_ESCROW.APPR_USER_ID IS '승인자(Maker-Checker) - 등록자와 동일인 불가';

-- FDI 에스크로 거래 : 예치(타발)·지급(거주자 NEFT/RTGS 또는 계좌)·반환(당발) 거래.
