COMMENT ON TABLE TB_FX_EXCHANGE IS '환전 거래';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.FX_REF_NO IS '환전 참조번호';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.FX_TYPE IS '환전유형 - CODE:FX_TYPE';
