COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.TRX_DT IS '거래일';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.SELL_CCY IS '고객 지급 통화';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.SELL_AMT IS '고객 지급 금액';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.SELL_ACCT_NO IS '출금계좌 - 현찰이면 NULL';
