COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.INR_EQV_AMT IS 'INR 환산(과세표준 기준)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.PURPOSE_CODE IS '목적 - 현찰판매(여행)는 LRS Purpose';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.PAN_SNAP IS 'PAN - 현찰판매·고액매입 필수';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.PASSPORT_NO IS '여권번호 - 비계좌·외국인 현찰매입';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.CDF_NO IS 'CDF 번호 - 현찰매입 기준 초과 시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.ENCASH_CERT_YN IS 'Encashment Certificate 발급 - 현찰·TT 매입 시 고객 요청';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.FX_STS IS '상태 - 10등록/20승인/40완료/90취소';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.REG_USER_ID IS '등록자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.REG_TS IS '등록일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.UPD_USER_ID IS '수정자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_FX_EXCHANGE.UPD_TS IS '수정일시';
