COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_RATE.REG_TS IS '등록일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_RATE.UPD_USER_ID IS '수정자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_RATE.UPD_TS IS '수정일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_IO_RATE.APPR_USER_ID IS '승인자(Maker-Checker) - 등록자와 동일인 불가';

