COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_LC_PRESENTATION.APPR_USER_ID IS '승인자(Checker) - Maker와 동일인 불가';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_LC_PRESENTATION.AUTH_USER_ID IS 'Authorizer - ALCO 기준금액 초과 시';
