);
COMMENT ON TABLE TB_BG_MASTER IS '보증서(BG/SBLC)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.BG_REF IS '보증 참조';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.BG_SCOPE IS '구분 - INLAND / OUTWARD(해외수익자) / INWARD_CG(역보증 수령 후 국내 발행)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.BG_TYPE IS '보증유형 - FIN 금융 / PERF 이행 / BID 입찰 / ADVPMT 선급금 / SBLC / CUSTOMS';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.RULES IS '준거규칙 - URDG758/ISP98/LOCAL(인도계약법)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.CUST_NO IS '보증의뢰인';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.BENE_NAME IS '수익자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.BENE_BANK_IFSC IS '수익자 은행 IFSC - 국내: IFN 760COV 수신은행';
