COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.CCY IS '통화';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.BG_AMT IS '보증금액';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.ISSUE_DT IS '발행일';
