COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.BG_STS IS '상태 - DRAFT/ISSUED/AMEND/INVOKE/PAID/EXPIRED/CLAIMX(청구기간 종료)/CANCEL';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.REG_USER_ID IS '등록자(Maker)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.REG_TS IS '등록일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.UPD_USER_ID IS '수정자';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.UPD_TS IS '수정일시';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.APPR_USER_ID IS '승인자(Checker) - Maker와 동일인 불가';
COMMENT ON COLUMN TB_BG_MASTER.AUTH_USER_ID IS 'Authorizer - ALCO 기준금액 초과 시';
